  "description": "Removal of two front facing extensions and adjustment to front facing fenestration; two new side facing dormers at roof level and extension over three floors to the rear with revised fenestration throughout.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed roof extensions due to their scale, design and siting, would appear as an intrusive and dominant addition to the host dwelling and the surrounding area adversely affecting the existing, cohesive streetscene. Therefore, the proposal would result in harm to the character and appearance of the host dwelling and the The Berg Estate Local Area of Special Character, contrary to Policies DM10, DM12 of the Core Strategy (2012), Policies D3 and HC1 of the London Plan (2021) and Paragraph 135 of the NPPF (2024)."
